{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DangerousDark"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let dark = DangerousDark()          \/\/ stock prose, one turn of grace","","var content: GameContents {","    dark","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon counts consecutive turns "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"ending","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in darkness, wherever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they’re spent — lingering is lethal, movement is not — so the warning"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn is a guarantee (the classic fairness contract) and a lightless dash"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"toward daylight can still succeed. Any reachable light resets the count."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Death is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dice roll"}]},{"text":" once the grace runs out, the original’s grue:","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first dark turn only warns, a configurable grace of guaranteed-safe"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turns follows, and then every further dark turn rolls "},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be eaten. The warning is always safe, so a revived player (UNDO) still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gets the warning beat before the dice can turn on them again."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make the dark harmless for a stretch — a room whose solution is to stand"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in it on purpose, a scene that should not be interrupted — set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not stop the daemon by name."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming can land the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player straight on a dice turn and cost them the warning; suspending resets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the count for exactly that reason."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon is named ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"grue\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Timer names are global, but two instances","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"code":"DangerousDark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in one game already collide on their shared ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"namespace before the timer name matters — one lethal dark per game.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"DangerousDark","modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DangerousDark"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DangerousDark","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that kills: a warning on the first consecutive turn the player"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends in the dark, a configurable grace period, then death. Add it to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s "},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block; there is nothing else to wire:"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(warning:death:graceTurns:lethality:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/GameContent-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(warning:death:graceTurns:lethality:)"],"anchor":"The-content-bundle","generated":true,"title":"The content bundle"}],"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/suspended":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/suspended","kind":"s